---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Trade Exposure — HormuzTracker.tech" description="Country-by-country trade exposure analysis and industry supply chain pathways affected by the Hormuz crisis." path="/exposure">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 space-y-6" id="exposure-page">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Trade Exposure & Industry Impact</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">How the Hormuz crisis ripples through global industries</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Regional Oil Import Dependency -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Regional Oil Import Dependency</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-700/50">
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Country</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">bbl/day</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Hormuz Dependency</th>
              <th class="text-center py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Risk Level</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">Japan</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">3.1M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-red font-bold">88%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-red/20 text-crisis-red">CRITICAL</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">Saudi Arabia</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">7.2M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-red font-bold">95%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-red/20 text-crisis-red">CRITICAL</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">South Korea</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">2.1M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-red font-bold">73%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-red/20 text-crisis-red">CRITICAL</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">India</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">2.5M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-orange font-bold">64%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-orange/20 text-crisis-orange">HIGH</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">China</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">4.0M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-orange font-bold">40%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-orange/20 text-crisis-orange">HIGH</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">Singapore</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">1.1M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-orange font-bold">85%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-orange/20 text-crisis-orange">HIGH</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">Taiwan</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">0.9M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-amber font-bold">72%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-amber/20 text-crisis-amber">HIGH</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">Thailand</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">0.8M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-amber font-bold">65%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-amber/20 text-crisis-amber">MODERATE</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">European Union</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">1.8M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-amber font-bold">14%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-amber/20 text-crisis-amber">MODERATE</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">Australia</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">0.4M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-amber font-bold">35%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-amber/20 text-crisis-amber">MODERATE</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50"><td class="py-2 text-white">United States</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">0.5M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-green font-bold">5%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-green/20 text-crisis-green">LOW</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-2 text-white">Brazil</td><td class="text-right text-slate-400">0.3M</td><td class="text-right text-crisis-green font-bold">8%</td><td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-crisis-green/20 text-crisis-green">LOW</span></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Industry Supply Chain Pathways -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Industry Supply Chain Pathways</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">How the Hormuz disruption cascades through key industries</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-red/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-red mb-1">Oil Refining</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Feedstock shortage forces throughput cuts. Refineries designed for Gulf crude struggle to process alternative grades. Margins compressed between rising input costs and demand destruction.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-red/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-red mb-1">Shipping</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Container rates +180% as Cape detour ties up vessels. Global container shortage as ships delayed on longer routes. Insurance costs make many routes unprofitable.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-orange/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-orange mb-1">Petrochemicals</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Naphtha and ethylene feedstock prices surge. Asian petrochemical producers (South Korea, Japan) face existential margin pressure. End-product prices rising through supply chain.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-orange/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-orange mb-1">LNG & Gas</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">No pipeline bypass for LNG. Qatar force majeure triggers global gas price surge. European energy transition plans disrupted as alternative LNG sources maxed out.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-amber/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-amber mb-1">Agriculture</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Fertilizer prices surge (natural gas is key feedstock). Food production costs rising globally. Developing nations most affected by food price inflation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-amber/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-amber mb-1">Aviation</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Jet fuel prices tracking crude upward. Airlines facing 30-50% fuel cost increases. Flight reductions on unprofitable routes. Air cargo rates surging.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Pharmaceuticals</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Petrochemical-derived active ingredients facing supply constraints. Temperature-controlled shipping disrupted. Generic drug manufacturing margins squeezed.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Electronics</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Semiconductor manufacturing energy costs rising. Supply chain delays for components shipped through affected routes. Manufacturing margin pressure in East Asia.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
